+        "147d542ec7ab6e20d9270b20e9169b11": "**UI Construction Deep Dive**\n\nOkay, here's the breakdown of how I'm approaching this UI composition. The core goal is to generate a tree structure using a Lisp-like S-expression syntax.  We're given specific component requirements, data models, and constraints, which I'll adhere to precisely.\n\nFirst, the root node is established as a `Column` with the ID \"root.\" This serves as the container for the entire UI. Within this root, I'll nest two distinct `Card` components.  The grammar dictates that children are *always* nested.  No flat adjacency lists or external IDs.  This means using positional arguments after properties in our S-Expressions.\n\nInside the root, a `data` block is used to initialize the state. `/breeds` is an array of dog breed image URLs, `/form` will manage user input for breed generation (name, legs, skills), and `/generated` is where the output description will reside.\n\nThe first `Card` is the \"Dog Breed Information Card.\" It contains another `Column`, with a `Text` title, an `Image` header, and finally a `List` displaying dog breed images horizontally. The `List` utilizes a `template` to dynamically render image components from the `/breeds` data.\n\nThe second `Card` represents the \"Dog Generator Card\".  This contains another `Column` as a container. Inside are text descriptions, `TextField`s for breed name and leg count, and a `ChoicePicker` for skills. There\u2019s a `Button` with the label \"Generate\" triggering an `Event` that takes the form data. I'm carefully using `:child` to attach the button's label, because that's what the catalog says.  Following the button, is a `Divider` and a `Column` that will hold the generated breed details using a `Text` element.\n\nI've made certain to follow the rules about the child parameter on the `Card`, `Button`, and other components, especially that a component node may need to be a child, or using the `:child` syntax. It's a clean way to handle component nesting based on the structure.  All form data and generated content are bound to corresponding data paths (`$/form/name`, `$/generated/output`, etc.).  I've double-checked all component signatures, and they appear correct. All of the required UI components have been assembled!\n\n\n",
+        "2abb1acc7c1965d92123c23ba07f0892": "<a2ui>\n(Column :id \"root\"\n  (data\n    $/breeds [\n      (:img \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517849845537-4d257902454a\" :name \"Golden Retriever\")\n      (:img \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507146426996-ef05306b995a\" :name \"Pug\")\n      (:img \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583511655857-d19b40a7a54e\" :name \"French Bulldog\")\n    ]\n    $/form (:name \"\" :legs \"4\" :skills [])\n    $/generated (:output \"Submit the form above to generate your custom dog breed!\"))\n\n  (Card :child\n    (Column\n      (Text :text \"Famous Dog breeds\" :variant \"body\")\n      (Image :url \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543466835-00a7907e9de1\" :description \"Famous Dog Breeds Header\" :variant \"header\")\n      (List :direction \"horizontal\" :children\n        (template :item breed\n          (Image :url $/breed/img :description $/breed/name :variant \"smallFeature\")))))\n\n  (Card :child\n    (Column\n      (Text :text \"Dog Generator\" :variant \"body\")\n      (Text :text \"Create your very own fictional dog breed with custom traits and skills!\" :variant \"caption\")\n      (TextField :label \"Dog Breed Name\" :value $/form/name :placeholder \"e.g., Nebular Retriever\" :variant \"shortText\")\n      (TextField :label \"Number of Legs\" :value $/form/legs :placeholder \"4\" :variant \"number\")\n      (ChoicePicker :label \"Skills\" :variant \"multipleSelection\" :options [\"Super Jump\" \"Telepathy\" \"Lava Resistance\" \"Invisibility\" \"Sonic Bark\"] :value $/form/skills :displayStyle \"chips\")\n      (Button :variant \"primary\" :action (Event \"generateBreed\" :name $/form/name :legs $/form/legs :skills $/form/skills) :child (Text :text \"Generate\"))\n      (Divider :axis \"horizontal\")\n      (Column\n        (Text :text \"Generated Breed Result\" :variant \"body\")\n        (Text :text $/generated/output :variant \"caption\")))))\n</a2ui>",
