wo cards in a column - check.  Card 1, Title, header image, horizontal image list sourced from `/breeds` in the data model, complete.  Card 2, Title, Description, input for dog breed, and legs, \"Generate\" button, choice picker for skills, a divider, and a generated content section \u2013 everything is here.\n\nThis response is exceptionally well-structured and fully adheres to the specified requirements.\n\nGRADE: C\n\n\n",
+        "a1eebb29be44256f7272f27811049c37": "To determine whether the submission meets the criterion, we can break down the evaluation step-by-step:\n\n1. **A2UI Payload & Surface ID**:\n   * The submission contains a valid A2UI JSON payload with `\"surfaceId\": \"main\"`.\n\n2. **Vertical List (Root)**:\n   * The root component (`root`) is a `Column`, which serves as a vertical list containing two child components: `node_0` and `node_6`.\n\n3. **Dog Breed Information Card**:\n   * `node_0` is a `Card` containing a `Column` with:\n     * A Title: \"Famous Dog breeds\" (`node_2`, `Text` component).\n     * A Header Image: (`node_3`, `Image` component with `variant: \"header\"`).\n     * A horizontal list of breeds: (`node_4`, `List` component with `direction: \"horizontal\"` and the path set to `/breeds`).\n     * The item template (`node_5`) is an `Image` displaying the breed picture and name.\n     * The data model indeed contains breed data under `/breeds`.\n\n4. **Dog Generator Card**:\n   * `node_6` is a `Card` containing a `Column` with the following form elements:\n     * **Title**: \"Dog Generator\" (`node_8`, `Text` component).\n     * **Description Text**: \"Create your very own fictional dog breed...\" (`node_9`, `Text` component).\n     * **Dog Breed Name (Text Input)**: `node_10`, `TextField` with `variant: \"shortText\"`.\n     * **Number of Legs (Number Input)**: `node_11`, `TextField` with `variant: \"number\"`.\n     * **Skills ChoicePicker**: `node_12`, `ChoicePicker` with `variant: \"multipleSelection\"`.\n     * **\"Generate\" Button**: `node_13`, `Button` with the label \"Generate\", passing the form data to an action.\n     * **Divider**: `node_15`, `Divider` component.\n     * **Generated Section**: `node_16`, a section demonstrating the output with a reference to the data model path `/generated/output`.\n\nAll criteria listed in the prompt are successfully met.\n\nGRADE: C",
